# STEP files are build-time inputs to scripts/prepare-demo-cad.ts, not runtime
# data — Cascadia-App's seed treats them as optional and seeds from glb/ +
# thumbnails/ + manifest.json alone. They are gitignored, so a CI build never
# sees them; excluding them here keeps a maintainer's local build byte-comparable
# instead of silently producing a ~590 MB image.
robot-arm/step
robot-arm/step-merged

# Nothing else in the repo belongs in the image. These patterns are root-anchored
# (Docker's `*` does not cross `/`), so `*.md` drops this repo's README while
# robot-arm/README.md, which documents the dataset, still ships.
.git
.github
scripts
node_modules
*.md
